# Local agent rules

1. Read `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT.md`, and `docs/agent/COMMON_GATES.md` before non-trivial work
2. **Fingerprint gate:** if PROJECT.md is still Example/unfilled or verify cmds don't match repo → stop and fill first
3. **Overlays win:** `.cursor/rules/01-*.mdc` + root AGENTS/CLAUDE/PROJECT override this `00-*` file when they conflict
4. Read `memory/working.md` at session start
5. Long runs: `docs/agent/LONGEVITY.md` + `FAILURE_RECOVERY.md` + `HARDWARE_LOCAL.md`
6. Web: `docs/agent/WEB.md` + recipes; after code changes run PROJECT.md Post-change/restart when defined
7. Unreal: `unreal/00_INDEX.md` + `BRIDGE_LIMITS.md` + `13_HUMAN_STEPS_MUTATION.md` + recipes
8. One queue item per turn; status must include memory updated / task / retries / next
9. Recipe -> patch -> **observe** verify; keep Unreal graphs editable
10. Bridge no/partial or mutation gated: never fake PIE/writes
11. On failure: gist -> fix -> retry (max 3) -> continue or block
12. No invented scope; no secrets; human owns architecture, merge, deploy, PIE/visual
